    <string name="oa_why_djvu">DjVu cannot be shown here: the only complete decoder (DjVuLibre) is GPL-licensed, which this app cannot include. Open it with a DjVu app or convert it to PDF there.</string>
    <string name="oa_why_chm">CHM help files use LZX compression, and no permissively licensed decoder is available for Android.</string>
    <string name="oa_why_rar">RAR / CBR archives cannot be opened here: the available decoders carry the restrictive UnRAR licence. Repack it as ZIP / CBZ or 7z / CB7 to open it here.</string>
    <string name="oa_why_dwg">DWG is a closed AutoCAD format without a permissively licensed reader. Save it as DXF or PDF to view it here.</string>
    <string name="oa_why_woff2">WOFF2 fonts need Brotli decompression, which is not included. TTF, OTF and WOFF fonts can be previewed.</string>
    <string name="oa_why_iwork">Apple Numbers / Pages / Keynote files use a private format. The preview stored in the file is shown when there is one; export to XLSX / DOCX / PDF to view the whole document.</string>
    <string name="oa_why_drm">This e-book is protected by DRM and cannot be opened.</string>
    <string name="oa_why_huff">This Kindle book uses HUFF/CDIC compression, which is not supported. Convert it to EPUB to read it here.</string>
    <string name="oa_why_encrypted">This file is password-protected.</string>
    <string name="oa_why_zip_android">Android refused this archive because it contains unsafe paths.</string>
